node_modules/
dist/
out/
build/
.remotion/
*.log
.DS_Store
.env
.env.local
coverage/
.vite/
.turbo/
# Markdown under `.scratch/` is the repository's local issue tracker and is versioned.
# Generated render artifacts stay local so `git add -A` cannot pick up videos or frames.
.scratch/**
!.scratch/**/
!.scratch/*.md
!.scratch/**/*.md
# The cloud phase's evidence is the exception. A FINDINGS.md that cites a result
# file nobody else can open is an assertion, not a record, and the branch is
# pushed now: these are small, textual, and the thing the criteria are ticked
# against. Renders and frames stay out — this names the evidence, not a folder.
!.scratch/cloud-phase/**/*.json
!.scratch/cloud-phase/**/*.log
!.scratch/cloud-phase/**/*.txt

# The crew is a self-contained Python project; its environment, caches and build metadata
# are local.
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/
